<p>You become difficult to target through the thick smog generated by your Miasma Engine. While surrounded by miasma you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1%, 4%, 6%, 7%, 8%</acronym> chance to entirely avoid damage, increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0%, 1%, 2%, 2%, 2%</acronym> per stack.</p>